# .env.test - the client build no longer embeds any Teable credentials; the
# dashboard reads Teable through the server-side proxy (dashboard/functions/),
# which holds its own credentials outside this file. Kept as the mode-test
# env file for `npm run build -- --mode test` (.no-mistakes.yaml gate).
# The Brands/Kingdom tab (the old gen.aditor.ai backend calls) was removed in 2026-07,
# so the Teable read is the app's only network boundary.
